# Temperance marker — test/165-vitest-coverage-threshold

- date: 2026-09-20
- branch: test/165-vitest-coverage-threshold
- goal_id: cli#165 vitest coverage config

## Scope decision

Add vitest coverage config + npm test:coverage script + @vitest/coverage-v8 devDep per architect-review 2026-09-20 finding M3.

- **Right thing?** Yes — no coverage measurement today; future refactors have no coverage-regression guard.
- **Simplest?** Yes — one config edit + one dep + one script; no test-content changes.
- **Brute force?** No — v8 provider matches vitest ^2.0.0; thresholds set below current actuals so tests still pass.
- **Blast radius?** Low — adds a dev-only measurement lane; production behavior unchanged.
- **Verification?** Run `npm run test:coverage` locally; check PR body for actuals.
- **Reversible?** Fully — one revert removes the config, script, and dep.
